# build output: the Rust workspace target/ plus every Go module's own target/
# (the AGENTS.md build/test flow writes target/{debug,release}/ siblings under
# whichever module dir `go build -C <module> -o target/...` runs from), so the
# pattern is recursive rather than an enumeration that goes stale when a new
# module appears.
**/target/
# a local `go build -o ../target/...` mishap can drop a binary directly under a
# module dir — never commit it
control-plane/freehold-agent-tools
**/.freehold/

# terraform state is sensitive — never committed
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/

# node deps for the ai-pr-review workflow
node_modules/
roadmap/CP_DRIVEN_BUILD.md